  <main class="container">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> ▸ <a href="/topics/">Topics</a> ▸ <strong>QA / Field Testing</strong></div>
    <header class="page-title">
      <h1>QA / Field Testing</h1>
      <p class="muted">Consistent sampling, correct methods, and tight documentation. Coordinate acceptance criteria with specs/WVDOH.</p>
      <p class="muted">Also see: <a href="/topics/curing.html">Curing</a> · <a href="/topics/specs-mixes.html">Specs & Mixes</a></p>
    </header>

    <section class="grid">
      <article class="card">
        <h2>Sampling &amp; Timing</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Sample per ASTM C172; take from middle of load, not first/last discharge.</li>
          <li>Start tests promptly; keep samples out of sun/wind; note time and truck ID.</li>
          <li>Re-mix test portion before slump/air/cylinders as required.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2>Fresh Concrete Tests</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Slump / Flow:</strong> ASTM C143 / C1611 (SCC) — level base, proper rodding/strokes.</li>
          <li><strong>Air content:</strong> ASTM C231 (pressure) or C173 (roll-a-meter for lightweight).</li>
          <li><strong>Temperature:</strong> ASTM C1064 — measure and record delivery temp.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2>Cylinders &amp; Handling</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>ASTM C31 — make, finish, protect from vibration and moisture loss; initial cure within temp range.</li>
          <li>Transport to the lab carefully; document chain-of-custody; avoid freezing or overheating.</li>
          <li>Breaks per ASTM C39; compare to specified strength and acceptance criteria.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2>Acceptance &amp; Documentation</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Verify acceptance criteria (ACI 301/WVDOH) for strength/air/slump/tolerance.</li>
          <li>Log admixtures, water additions, ambient/weather, and delays.</li>
          <li>Share results rapidly with the team to adjust operations if needed.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2>References</h2>
        <ul class="muted">
          <li>ASTM C172, C143, C1611, C231, C173, C1064, C31, C39</li>
          <li>ACI 301 — Specifications for Concrete Construction</li>
          <li>WVDOH testing/acceptance provisions (project-specific)</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </section>

    <p><a href="/topics/">← Back to Topics</a></p>
  </main>

